                            <comment id="15228652" author="mmerli" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 17:02:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;..so, the test it&apos;s intermittently failing, because it depends on which bookie gets chosen for the test&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
